# Line endings: LF in the repository and on disk, on every OS (Prettier also
# writes LF). Rule in CLAUDE.md, section 11.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never converted. The repo has none today; listed so a first image
# or font does not get corrupted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
